sloth-loop is an LLM-free task-orchestration engine.  It does not embed any
language model, hold any credentials, or make any LLM calls; the “thinking”
is outsourced to whatever agent (Codex / Claude …) mounts it.  See
docs/design/loop-vs-agent-quota-and-boundary.md for the full boundary.

Third-party dependencies are listed in pyproject.toml / requirements*.txt and
remain under their own licenses.
